          %p
            denote the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Verschiebung+morphism"} Verschiebung morphism
            which is a morphism of the underlying additive groups. Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
